    "title": "Yadeta (2024) – seed yield of vetch and oat mixtures, RCBD with 5 treatments in 5 blocks (data rebuilt from Table 5)",
    "statement": "Five treatments (sole Oat Bona-bas, sole Oat Bonsa, sole Vetch Gebisa, and two vetch-oat mixtures) were grown in a randomized complete block design with 5 replications, and the seed yield (t/ha) was measured. The paper prints only the treatment means, the grand mean (1.8) and CV = 18.68 %, so the 25 yields were rebuilt to reproduce those exactly, with no block effect (no block values were published). Does the mean seed yield differ between the treatments? Test at α = 0.05. Source: Journal of Scientific Agriculture 8:51-58, Table 5.",
